  "notes": "Draft by Claude, 21 Oct 2026, from the recipe audit on the project page. The plate, then bread and cheese land on it, pickle tips out of the jar, a dab of wholegrain mustard, and it smells good. The library's “lunch” picture is a bowl of soup, so the story ends on the plate; Codex is asked for a ploughman's plate to appear and be served.",
